(text "Internal LDO mode. VCAP is not 3V3 and carries no external load.\nTwo local2.2uF low-ESR capacitors; ESR <100mOhm.\nAN4938 Rev7 requires VCAP pins tied. VDDA/VREF locally bypassed.\nUSB supply is internally bonded toVDD in this LQFP100 package." (at 227 229 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid e11bef26-914e-497a-a2d7-45ac76458f67))
(text "OUT1-4 TIM1 / OUT5-6 TIM8 / OUT7-8 TIM4.\nThree timer-rate groups; DMA/DShot needs bench validation.\nDedicated SPI1 IMU / SPI2 NAND / SPI3 external bus.\nGPIO alternate roles share physical pins.\nRaw ADC needs conditioning; no direct LiPo or servo power." (at 12 213 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid 350d6679-3383-4c6e-9622-ad5b9c3cf6eb))
